  "verdict": "revise",
  "scores": {
    "novelty": {
      "score": 3,
      "rationale": "Each core component exists in prior work: DéjàQ already performs online MAP-Elites with quality-based replacement during RL (at GSM level); SwS does offline weakness-targeted synthesis; Prism maintains structured diversity during self-evolving RLVR; VCRL validates advantage-variance learnability. The genuine novelty—2D interpretable archive at competition level with continuous online weakness re-identification—is a clean engineering contribution but is incremental rather than conceptually new."
